@startuml APIGateway_Context_BDD
title Block Definition Diagram - API-Gateway (External Context)

left to right direction

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor LightSteelBlue
  BorderColor Black
  FontSize 11
}

class "API-Gateway" as APIGateway <<block>>
class "External-Service\n(Web UI)" as ExternalService <<block>>
class "Orchestrator" as Orchestrator <<block>>
class "Redis\n(Rate Limiting)" as Redis <<block>>

ExternalService --> APIGateway : HTTP requests
APIGateway --> Orchestrator : forward /api/v1/orchestrator/**
APIGateway --> Redis : rate limiting state

legend right
  --> : directed association
endlegend

@enduml